#capitulo("Buddha-dhamma-saṅgha-guṇā")
#metadata((tipo: "cap", titulo: "Buddha-dhamma-saṅgha-guṇā")) <toc>

#paritta[#metadata((tipo: "primera-linea", texto: "Iti pi so bhagavā")) <primera-linea>
Iti pi so bhagavā arahaṁ sammā-sambuddho #linebreak() 
Vijjā-caraṇa-sampanno sugato loka-vidū #linebreak() 
Anuttaro purisa-damma-sārathi #linebreak() 
Satthā devamanussānaṁ buddho bhagavā'ti

Svākkhāto bhagavatā dhammo sandiṭṭhiko akāliko ehi-passiko #linebreak() 
Opanayiko paccattaṁ veditabbo viññūhī'ti

Supaṭipanno bhagavato sāvaka-saṅgho #linebreak() 
Uju-paṭipanno bhagavato sāvaka-saṅgho #linebreak() 
Ñāya-paṭipanno bhagavato sāvaka-saṅgho #linebreak() 
Sāmīci-paṭipanno bhagavato sāvaka-saṅgho #linebreak() 
Yad-idaṁ cattāri purisa-yugāni aṭṭha purisa-puggalā #linebreak() 
Esa bhagavato sāvaka-saṅgho #linebreak() 
Āhuneyyo pāhuneyyo dakkhiṇeyyo añjali-karaṇīyo #linebreak() 
Anuttaraṁ puññakkhettaṁ lokassā'ti
]

#pagebreak()

#capitulo("Mora-parittaṁ")
#metadata((tipo: "cap", titulo: "Mora-parittaṁ")) <toc>

#paritta[#metadata((tipo: "primera-linea", texto: "Udet'ayañ-cakkhumā eka-rājā")) <primera-linea>
Udet'ayañ-cakkhumā eka-rājā #linebreak() 
Harissa-vaṇṇo paṭhavippabhāso #linebreak() 
Taṁ taṁ namassāmi #linebreak() 
Harissa-vaṇṇaṁ paṭhavippabhāsaṁ #linebreak() 
Tay'ajja guttā viharemu divasaṁ #linebreak() 
Ye brāhmaṇā vedagu sabba-dhamme

#twochants(([Te me namo], [te ca maṁ pālayantu]), ([Nam'atthu buddhānaṁ], [nam'atthu bodhiyā]), ([Namo vimuttānaṁ], [namo vimuttiyā]), ([Imaṁ so parittaṁ katvā], [moro carati esanā'ti]))

Apet'ayañ-cakkhumā eka-rājā #linebreak() 
Harissa-vaṇṇo paṭhavippabhāso #linebreak() 
Taṁ taṁ namassāmi #linebreak() 
Harissa-vaṇṇaṁ paṭhavippabhāsaṁ #linebreak() 
Tay'ajja guttā viharemu rattiṁ #linebreak() 
Ye brāhmaṇā vedagu sabba-dhamme

#twochants(([Te me namo], [te ca maṁ pālayantu]), ([Nam'atthu buddhānaṁ], [nam'atthu bodhiyā]), ([Namo vimuttānaṁ], [namo vimuttiyā]), ([Imaṁ so parittaṁ katvā], [moro vāsam-akappayī'ti]))

]

