Tan-tejasā bhavatu te jaya-maṅgalāni

Nandopananda-bhujagaṁ vibudhaṁ mah'iddhiṁ #linebreak() 
Puttena thera-bhujagena damāpayanto #linebreak() 
Iddhūpadesa-vidhinā jitavā mun'indo #linebreak() 
Tan-tejasā bhavatu te jaya-maṅgalāni

Duggāha-diṭṭhi-bhujagena sudaṭṭha-hatthaṁ #linebreak() 
Brahmaṁ visuddhi-jutim-iddhi-bakābhidhānaṁ #linebreak() 
Ñāṇāgadena vidhinā jitavā mun'indo #linebreak() 
Tan-tejasā bhavatu te jaya-maṅgalāni

Etā pi buddha-jaya-maṅgala-aṭṭha-gāthā #linebreak() 
Yo vācano dina-dine saratem-atandī #linebreak() 
